'''A Whole New World''' is the only stage in [[Zero Field]]. This [[No Continues]] stage introduces [[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]], who can be unlocked as [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat X]]'s [[True Form]] after clearing the stage.

After beating A Whole New World and all [[Zombie Outbreaks]], the [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Filibuster Invasion Outbreak]] will appear in a random [[Cats of the Cosmos]] stage, which can then be cleared for a [[Legend Capsules (Gacha Event)|Legend Ticket]] and Metafilibuster's [[Talents]].

