==Trivia==
*A Whole New World may be a reference to the [[wikipedia:A Whole New World|song of the same name]] from the 1992 Disney movie ''Aladdin''.
*A Whole New World is the only [[Zero Legends]] stage without black-and-red particles that slowly rise up from the bottom of the screen. Instead, it has groups of hexagons that phase in and out of the foreground throughout the [[Battle|battle]].

